cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use hsquared (or the Julia twin HSquared.jl), please cite it as below."
title: "hsquared: R interface for Julia-backed quantitative-genetic models"
abstract: >-
  R-facing twin of HSquared.jl for open, sparse, inheritance-aware quantitative
  genetics (animal models, relationship matrices, REML, breeding values, and
  planned genomic / non-standard inheritance surfaces). Twin DOI pending (hub
  D-23); cite both repositories together once the shared DOI is deposited.
type: software
